OL,3,ATrump leaves China after holding
OL,4,Ahistoric 90-minute talks with Xi and
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has left China after
OL,8,Fholding talks for about 90 minutes with
OL,9,FRussian President Vladimir Putin and Xi
OL,10,FJinping in the city of Shenzhen
OL,12,FAs the meeting began, President Xi said
OL,13,Fthe talks had "groundbreaking
OL,14,Fsignificance" - Trump said they were
OL,15,F"really making history"
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Putin said Russia, China,
OL,18,Fand the US share a "joint
OL,19,Fresponsibility" for "maintaining
OL,20,Finternational peace and security"
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
